      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iidda Waababka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaad wax ka soo urursataan goobihiinna hadhuudhka lagu tumo iyo macsarooyinkiinna canabka, dabadeed waa inaad dhawrtaan Iidda Waababka intii toddoba maalmood ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo midkiin kasta iyo wiilkiisa, iyo gabadhiisa, iyo addoonkiisa, iyo addoontiisa, iyo ka reer Laawi, iyo qariibka, iyo agoonta, iyo carmalka irdahooda ku jiraaba waa inay ku wada farxaan iiddiinna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo intii toddoba maalmood ah waa inaad iid Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah ugu qabataan meesha Rabbigu dooranayo, maxaa yeelay, Rabbigu wuxuu idinku barakayn doonaa waxa idiin kordha oo dhan iyo shuqulka gacmihiinna oo dhan, oo dhammaantiin waxaad ahaan doontaan farax miidhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sannaddiiba saddex jeer raggiinna oo dhammu waa inay Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah kaga hor muuqdaan meeshuu dooranayo, oo saddexdaas jeer waa Iidda Kibista-aan-khamiirka-lahayn, iyo Iidda Toddobaadyada, iyo Iidda Waababka, oo waa inaanay iyagoo fara madhan Rabbiga hortiisa ka muuqan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nin waluba waa inuu bixiyo wixii uu awoodo sida ay tahay barakada Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu uu idin siiyey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
